error[E0277]: `url.scheme` is sampling-relevant on span `http.server.request` and can't be recorded after start
 --> tests/compile_errors/06_sampling_relevant_too_late.rs:7:30
  |
7 |     let span = record!(span, url.scheme: "https", url.path: "/", shop.tenant.code: "ACME");
  |                              ^^^ set this in `span!` instead
  |
  = help: the trait `showcase::spans::http::server::request::BeforeStart_url_scheme` is not implemented for `showcase::spans::http::server::request::Started`
  = note: samplers only see attributes given when the span starts
help: the trait `showcase::spans::http::server::request::With<url_scheme>` is conditionally implemented for `showcase::spans::http::server::request::Builder<P0, P1, P2, P3, C>`
